  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sectoral Partnerships (SESAM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme is targeting entrepreneurs, based in the Netherlands, who want to make their value chain more sustainable.By entering into cooperation with companies and organizations within a certain sector, potential risks can be tackled together.The subsidy scheme Sectoral Cooperation international Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) provides support in this.</narrative>
  </description>
